          "english_quote": "But those who do not keep his commandments do not even have life in them.",
          "issue": "Independently against the Greek, this sentence changes singular “in him” to plural “in them” and explicitly presents the assertion as those people’s lack of life within themselves. That resolves a referential question the selected source leaves open. The shared note discloses the singular, but neither that disclosure nor agreement with the standard edition justifies the substitution.",
